## Measurement plan
- Re-export "Last 7 days" at day 7, 14 and 28 after each batch goes live (same page filter, same range length).
- Primary metric: **clicks per day** on the combined set, plus position. Do not judge by CTR while the surge distorts impressions.
- Use a control ratio (batch clicks divided by all other pages' clicks) so site-wide swings cancel out. Batch 1 and Batch 2 baselines are in v2.
- Update in sub-batches of about 10 pages. Keep 3C untouched as the control until it is released.
- Do not edit a page again before its window passes (title and meta 1 to 3 weeks, content 2 to 6). Request indexing in GSC after each publish, highest impressions first.

